    { q: "Is there an endpoint that lists every Tradovate symbol at once?", a: "No, there's no supported \"list all symbols\" call. Start from a known product root like ES, MES, NQ, or CL, query product/find and then contract/find or contract/suggest, and cache whatever results your app actually needs." },
